{"id":"b44df7aeba18e12f","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-subordinator.md","title":"Subordinator","display":"df-subordinator — Subordinator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-subordinator","aliases":["58-df-subordinator"],"display":"df-subordinator — Subordinator","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-subordinator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-subordinator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subordinator — Subordinator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0a20d5f74408674\" href=\"?note=d0a20d5f74408674\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md\">../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (Lévy-process predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0a20d5f74408674\" href=\"?note=d0a20d5f74408674\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md\">../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (subordinator predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subordinator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S(S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\n\\land\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\n\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\bigl(s\\leq t\\to S_s(\\xi)(0)\\leq S_t(\\xi)(0)\\bigr)\\right\\}\n\\right)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subordinator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S(S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\n\\land\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\n\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\bigl(s\\leq t\\to S_s(\\xi)(0)\\leq S_t(\\xi)(0)\\bigr)\\right\\}\n\\right)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Subordinators are one-dimensional Lévy processes with almost-surely nondecreasing paths; the coordinate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0)\">\\((0)\\)</span> makes the order on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^1\">\\(\\mathbb R^1\\)</span> explicit.</li>\n<li>They randomize time for other processes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (Lévy-process predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subordinator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S(S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(S,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\n\\land\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\n\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\bigl(s\\leq t\\to S_s(\\xi)(0)\\leq S_t(\\xi)(0)\\bigr)\\right\\}\n\\right)=1.","display":true},{"tex":"(0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^1","display":false}],"bytes":1048,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d66b7028c04efe8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subordinator}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-subordinator.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1252","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-subordinator.md|58-df-subordinator]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["d0a20d5f74408674"]}